1
00:00:01,705 --> 00:00:03,889
As Uke comes to strike the center of your head

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,058
raise both arms

3
00:00:05,259 --> 00:00:07,152
step in deeply to his rear

4
00:00:07,153 --> 00:00:08,142
cut down.

5
00:00:08,143 --> 00:00:09,166
As Uke comes round

6
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:12,226
controlling his wrist and elbow raise him up slightly

7
00:00:12,227 --> 00:00:16,011
switch the control of his wrist to the other hand
staying to his rear,

8
00:00:16,012 --> 00:00:16,785
cut down

9
00:00:16,786 --> 00:00:18,430
draw Uke´s body towards you.

10
00:00:20,031 --> 00:00:22,386
Sit down controlling Uke´s shoulder

11
00:00:22,387 --> 00:00:24,311
placing his shoulder in between your knees.

12
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:25,754
Changing the grip,

13
00:00:25,755 --> 00:00:28,048
put Uke´s wrist against your shoulder

14
00:00:28,049 --> 00:00:29,087
holding him tightly

15
00:00:29,088 --> 00:00:31,733
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

